                                <p><span class="bw-md" style="color: #212222">From operations to business development, to sales and client relationship I’ve been fortunate to find all of my growth opportunities within OSTTRA. Today I cover California and the Latin American market. It&#8217;s a fun and dynamic role in which I&#8217;ve learned the importance of listening, networking and building solid relationships both externally with my clients as well as internally colleagues who help me drive my sales efforts.</span></p>
                                <div class="body-xs mt-4">
                                    <p><span style="color: #212222;"><strong>Yuliana Rendon</strong></span><br />
<span style="color: #212222;">Sales &amp; Relationship Director, OSTTRA</span></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                                                        <div class="col-md-3 d-flex quote-img">
