                                <p><span class="bw-md" style="color: #212222">It&#8217;s been one year since I joined OSTTRA, and during this time, I&#8217;ve been on an exciting journey. At OSTTRA, we not only grow our working knowledge but also improve ourselves personally to be better. You get to experience all sorts of interesting things, including social activities, charity work, and meeting experienced people from different countries, which makes your job more colourful. Moreover, at OSTTRA, your voice and opinion can be heard. The team and organization are open to new ideas and innovative solutions, striving to do things more innovatively. They are very helpful and supportive, working together as one cohesive unit to face challenges.</span></p>
                                <div class="body-xs mt-4">
                                    <p><span style="color: #212222;"><strong>Furong Wong</strong></span><br />
<span style="color: #212222;">Application Support Engineer, OSTTRA</span></p>
